flowchart TD
    A[Seller has plaintext D] --> B["Generate K (256-bit), N (128-bit), s (256-bit)"]
    B --> C["C = HMAC-CTR(K, D)<br/>K_enc = HMAC(K, 0x01)"]
    C --> D["Commitments:<br/>hD = SHA256(D)<br/>hC = SHA256(C)<br/>cK = SHA256(K concat N concat s)"]
    D --> E[Upload C to IPFS<br/>get CID]
    E --> F[List on-chain:<br/>hD, hC, R_D, R_C, cK, CID, price]

    F --> G["Buyer pays: buy(assetId)"]
    G --> H["Deliver: encK = ECIES to buyer pubkey, stored on-chain"]
    H --> I["Buyer: unwrap K via ECIES"]
    I --> J["Buyer: D' = HMAC-CTR-decrypt(K, C)"]
    J --> K["Buyer: verify H(D') == hD"]

    K -->|Match| L["confirm() -> SETTLED, K stays confidential"]
    K -->|Mismatch| M["disputeMode1() or disputeMode2()"]

    M --> N[Dispute: K revealed publicly<br/>Anyone can decrypt C]
    N --> O[CONFIDENTIALITY LOST<br/>on dispute path]

    style A fill:#F8FAFC
    style L fill:#D1FAE5
    style O fill:#FEE2E2
    style N fill:#FEE2E2
